  "content_id": "16136092",
  "title": "Edge Captcha Feature: Account Protection and Troubleshooting",
  "description": "Edge uses Captcha to protect accounts against spam. The Captcha appears as a checkbox or image selection task.\n\nTroubleshooting Captcha Is...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">Edge uses Captcha to protect accounts against spam. The Captcha appears as a checkbox or image selection task.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Troubleshooting Captcha Issues:</b><br>Users may face challenges with the Captcha. If any of these occur, <a href=\"https://support.edge.app/hc/en-us/articles/26702768694811\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">force close</a> the Edge app and attempt login again:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Captcha does not load</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Images are invisible or partially displayed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Verification fails despite correct responses or multiple tries</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Force Close Steps:</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.edge.app/hc/en-us/articles/26702768694811\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">How to force close Edge (Android and iOS).</a></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Further Assistance:</b><br>If issues persist, ensure a stable internet connection or update the app.</p>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
  "state": "published",
  "created_at": 1772222767,
